.darius-cache/
.darius-pages/

# Sophie's own story text + the book's build state. This repo is PUBLIC and her
# unpublished fiction is not ours to publish — the plan and state are banked to
# membry Storage (storybook/marla/, private objects) instead.
docs/marla/

# Her unpublished stories — same reason as docs/marla/. Banked to membry
